01:17:19.508 --> 01:17:20.908
Ah, fuck.

1369
01:17:21.942 --> 01:17:23.210
Put him in the car.

1370
01:17:24.812 --> 01:17:26.380
-Fuck.
-It's just fucked, man.

1371
01:17:26.447 --> 01:17:28.182
Crazy.

1372
01:17:28.249 --> 01:17:29.917
Put him in the car.

1373
01:18:08.523 --> 01:18:11.859
[Bobby] <i>He didn't say a word</i>
<i>the entire drive.</i>

1374
01:18:30.945 --> 01:18:34.949
<i>If I was going to make</i>
<i>a move, it was going to</i>
<i>have to be soon.</i>

1375
01:18:35.015 --> 01:18:38.520
<i>But machine guns were</i>
<i>going to be a problem.</i>

1376
