1377
01:18:56.605 --> 01:18:58.506
Sorry, kid.

1378
01:19:00.174 --> 01:19:02.943
[Bobby]
<i>Roy loved Chris like a son.</i>

1379
01:19:14.488 --> 01:19:16.423
Don't shoot him
in the face, okay?

1380
01:19:37.911 --> 01:19:39.146
