[Bobby] <i>I found out later that</i>
<i>in order to appease</i>

1383
01:20:01.302 --> 01:20:03.270
<i>the Colombians, they had</i>
<i>to leave them out there.</i>

1384
01:20:03.337 --> 01:20:05.105
<i>You know, make</i>
<i>a big fucking show of it.</i>

1385
01:20:05.172 --> 01:20:07.207
<i>Make the news and all that.</i>

1386
