1389
01:20:49.116 --> 01:20:51.352
Eight o'clock.

1390
01:20:51.418 --> 01:20:54.154
-For what?
-Play some cards.

1391
01:20:58.992 --> 01:21:01.061
<i>James was dead. Chris was dead.</i>

1392
01:21:01.128 --> 01:21:02.963
<i>The whole thing was</i>
<i>a shit show.</i>

1393
01:21:05.600 --> 01:21:09.571
<i>I never stepped one foot</i>
<i>inside the Gemini Lounge again.</i>

1394
01:21:22.383 --> 01:21:24.251
You good?

1395
01:21:24.318 --> 01:21:25.587
Yeah.

1396
