<i>an example out of Rick and me.</i>

1413
01:22:43.932 --> 01:22:45.900
<i>If it wasn't for all</i>
<i>the evidence we got,</i>

1414
01:22:45.966 --> 01:22:49.303
<i>things could have</i>
<i>turned out a lot worse for us.</i>

1415
01:22:49.369 --> 01:22:51.405
<i>But none of it</i>
<i>saw the light of day.</i>

1416
01:22:51.472 --> 01:22:55.476
<i>The Department decided</i>
<i>to save face</i>
<i>and filed everything away.</i>

1417
01:22:57.545 --> 01:22:59.647
