<i>his days were numbered.</i>

1421
01:23:07.221 --> 01:23:08.890
<i>He was right.</i>

1422
01:23:08.957 --> 01:23:11.793
<i>Paul Costellano</i>
<i>ordered the hit.</i>

1423
01:23:11.860 --> 01:23:17.397
<i>And in the end,</i>
<i>his two most loyal soldiers</i>
<i>did the deed.</i>

1424
01:23:18.999 --> 01:23:24.304
<i>As for me, I couldn't</i>
<i>let it all be for nothing.</i>

1425
01:23:24.371 --> 01:23:26.641
<i>I made a call</i>
<i>and set up a meeting.</i>

1426
01:23:26.708 --> 01:23:30.277
