<i>the same thing I did.</i>

1427
01:23:30.344 --> 01:23:32.145
<i>I didn't know</i>
<i>what they looked like,</i>

1428
01:23:32.212 --> 01:23:36.216
<i>but they assured me</i>
<i>that they knew me. So I waited.</i>

1429
01:23:38.485 --> 01:23:41.923
<i>♪ Life is funny</i>
<i>Skies are sunny ♪</i>

1430
01:23:41.990 --> 01:23:48.462
<i>♪ Bees make honey</i>
<i>Who needs money ♪</i>

1431
01:23:48.530 --> 01:23:51.566
