1456
01:25:39.239 --> 01:25:41.141
<i>♪ Life is funny ♪</i>

1457
01:25:41.208 --> 01:25:43.276
<i>♪ Skies are sunny ♪</i>

1458
01:25:43.343 --> 01:25:46.413
<i>♪ Bees make honey</i>
<i>Oh yeah ♪</i>

1459
